\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces Collapse of the pure-quadrupole arm ($\varepsilon _2=0.01$, no radial kick). (a)~Minimal-surface areal radius (ink) and the scan's MOTS (gold) from $t=33$: $R$ $3.80\to 2.41$, $M_{\rm  MS}$ $1.90\to 1.24$. Grey: the unkicked level-4 twin, which inflates on its own seed; this arm leaves it by $10\%$ only at $t=42$---the second-order drive of the pure quadrupole. (b)--(d)~Global $\min \alpha $, $\min \chi $ (the origin, the far side's compactified infinity) and $\max |K|$; the violent phase spans $t=45$--$55$. (e),(f)~Radial profiles over 128{} shells, $t=33$--$55$ (light = early): $|K|$ grows inward while $\alpha $ pinches to zero at the centre. Constraint norms: Fig.~\ref {fig:constraints}(c). The collapse ends in a black hole that consumes its supporting field.}}{7}{figure.2}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:single_collapse}{{2}{7}{Collapse of the pure-quadrupole arm ($\varepsilon _2=\clmPureQuadAmpCaption $, no radial kick). (a)~Minimal-surface areal radius (ink) and the scan's MOTS (gold) from $t=\clmPureQuadMotsTime $: $R$ $\clmPureQuadMotsRStart \to \clmPureQuadMotsREnd $, $M_{\rm MS}$ $\clmPureQuadMotsMStart \to \clmPureQuadMotsMEnd $. Grey: the unkicked level-4 twin, which inflates on its own seed; this arm leaves it by $10\%$ only at $t=\clmPureQuadDeparture $---the second-order drive of the pure quadrupole. (b)--(d)~Global $\min \alpha $, $\min \chi $ (the origin, the far side's compactified infinity) and $\max |K|$; the violent phase spans $t=\clmCollapseViolentLo $--$\clmCollapseViolentHi $. (e),(f)~Radial profiles over \clmCollapseShells {} shells, $t=33$--$55$ (light = early): $|K|$ grows inward while $\alpha $ pinches to zero at the centre. Constraint norms: Fig.~\ref {fig:constraints}(c). The collapse ends in a black hole that consumes its supporting field}{figure.2}{}}
